# Clicks in a row and modifiers on clicks.wisp's Reset (x 8..98, y 8..40).
listen pointerdown pointerup click dblclick
click 50 24                   one click
expect event click button#reset
double-click 50 24            two clicks in a row, then dblclick
expect event dblclick button#reset
triple-click 50 24            a third press in a row: as Chromium does
expect event click button#reset
quadruple-click 50 24         a fourth press in a row: no second dblclick
expect event click button#reset
alt-click 50 24               a click with Alt held carries it
expect event click button#reset
tap 50 24                     a tap
expect event click button#reset
tap 50 24                     a second tap: dblclick as Chrome on Android
expect event dblclick button#reset
tap 50 24                     a third tap in a row: no dblclick, as the third click
expect event click button#reset
tap 50 24                     a fourth tap in a row
expect event click button#reset
tap 50 24                     a fifth tap in a row
expect event click button#reset
